# Core Agent Rules

This rule file points to the canonical `packs/core/RULES.md` for universal agent behavior.

**Primary source**: If this repo has an `AGENTS.md`, follow it. Otherwise, refer to `~/.aialchemylabs/packs/core/RULES.md` or the installed packs.

**Key points**:
- Plan first for non-trivial changes (>30 LOC, multi-file, new deps, API changes)
- Repo rules override org/user-global rules
- Enforcement (CI/lint/tests) overrides written guidance
- Profile selection (bun-stack vs node-stack) decides toolchain

See `packs/core/RULES.md` for full conflict resolution and behavior rules.
